## SQ-EFB-16-boot | earth fill off, timeout 5 in the toml
bootexpect Done \(
shell grep -qE '^\s*earthFill = false' config/creativeworldgen-common.toml && grep -qE '^\s*searchTimeoutSeconds = 5' config/creativeworldgen-common.toml && echo 'earthFill false, timeout 5'

## SQ-WGE-02c | mansion search ends after 5 s with its counters; tick under 100 ms; thread free
> locate structure minecraft:mansion
sleep 3
> forge tps
waitlog (timed out after|nearest minecraft:mansion is at) 120
expect timed out after 5 s
reject timed out after (120|300) s
> locate structure creativeengineering:meta/fortified_ruins
waitlog (nearest creativeengineering:meta/fortified_ruins.* is at|fortified_ruins.*timed out after) 120
look the Overall tick line under 100 ms during the search; the timeout line carries its counters; fortified ruins answered or timed out the same way

